     "content": "Unfortunately, the service is still down \u2014 I'm getting the same timeout errors.\n\nHere's where things stand:\n\n**What I was planning to do:**\n1. Search your emails for the hiking trip discussion with Mark to find the agreed date and the location mentioned\n2. Look up Mark's email address in your contacts\n3. Create a 5-hour calendar event with Mark invited and the correct location set\n\n**The blocker:** The backend service handling email, calendar, and contacts has been unavailable for every request I've made (about 20 attempts so far). This appears to be a temporary outage on the service side, not an issue with the request itself.\n\n**Options going forward:**\n- I can keep retrying periodically until the service comes back up\n- Alternatively, if you can tell me the details directly (Mark's email address, the date and start time for the hike, and the location from the email), I'll create the event as soon as the calendar service responds \u2014 or keep retrying in the meantime\n\nWould you like me to keep retrying, or do you have the details handy so we're ready to go the moment the service recovers?"
